{
  "slug": "tavily",
  "name": "Tavily",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build AI applications with real-time web data using Tavily's search, extract, crawl, and research APIs.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `tavily-best-practices` (Build production-ready Tavily integrations with best practices baked in), `tavily-cli` (Set up, authenticate, update, troubleshoot, or choose between Tavily CLI web commands), `tavily-crawl` (Crawl websites and extract content from multiple pages via the Tavily CLI), `tavily-dynamic-search` (Programmatic Tavily search with context isolation), `tavily-extract` (Extract clean markdown or text content from specific URLs via the Tavily CLI), `tavily-map` (Discover and list all URLs on a website without extracting content, via the Tavily CLI), `tavily-research` (Conduct comprehensive AI-powered research with citations via the Tavily CLI), `tavily-search` (Search the web with LLM-optimized results via the Tavily CLI)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tavily@claude-plugins-official` from `tavily-ai/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
